    /// `dimensions`, gemini `outputDimensionality`, voyage `dimensions`);
    /// absent = the model default. MiniMax does NOT carry it (embo-01 is
    /// fixed 1536 — the incumbent omits the field).
    pub dimensions: Option<u32>,
